  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands embassy in Beirut, Lebanon supports private sector development projects which prioritise job creation, export promotion, strengthening of local food security and supporting local value chains.By providing technical oversight and guidance across the embassy&apos;s agriculture-focused portfolio, this project ensures that interventions are appropriate, well-designed, effectively implemented and monitored, and strategically targeted to maximise these outcomes.This specific activity responds to an identified need for enhanced technical capacity, enabling the embassy to make more informed decisions and deliver greater impact in line with its Private Sector Development goals.</narrative>
  </description>
